## Interaction rules

- Use semantic HTML, full keyboard navigation and a visible focus indicator.
- Meet WCAG AA contrast. Label every control and field.
- Show validation errors next to the field that caused them.
- Asynchronous actions show progress, then a result or an error the user can act on.
- Respect reduced-motion preferences.

